    LLM: 'Remember the unusual trump structure (40 trumps!). Try to capture high trumps and Kings. Declare versicole when you have them.\n\nUse the Fola exchange wisely to improve your hand. Track which high cards have been played. Coordinate with partner to capture valuable cards.\n\nExpert card counting is essential with 97 cards. Optimize versicole declarations. Use the Fool strategically to avoid playing valuable cards on losing tricks. Master the complex scoring to maximize points.',
